flowchart TB
    Client[REST or WebSocket Client] --> Interface[Interface Layer]
    Interface --> Endpoints[FastAPI Endpoints]
    Interface --> Runtime[EMS Runtime]
    Runtime --> Services[Application Services]
    Services --> Solvers[MILP Solver and Heuristic Solver]
    Services --> Domain[Domain Models]
    Domain --> Portfolio[Portfolio and Load]
    Domain --> Metrics[Forward and Backward Metrics]
    Domain --> Plan[Plan]
    Services --> Ports[Domain Ports]
    Ports --> Forecast[Simple Forecast Provider]
    Ports --> Repository[Simple Portfolio Repository]
    Runtime --> WebSocket[WebSocket Broadcast]
